Z||000009||Cliff Pennock||09-25-2001||06:26 PM||||I didn't reboot (Linux servers hardly ever need a reboot  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ), I just moved a bit more messages to the archive. Up until now, a message wouldn't get archived until the last reply was more than 6 months old. I've changed that to 4 months which results in a few tens of thousands of active messages less. This <B>will</B> speed up the forum quite a bit. Maybe I'll lower it to 3 months since the speed improvement is worth it.||||reg||1
